cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these materials, please cite them as below."
title: "Structured Research Experience: Teaching Materials for Scientific Communication, Simulation Studies, and Reproducibility"
abstract: >-
  Open teaching materials for running a structured research experience in
  statistics. Includes an oral presentation assessment rubric, a guide to
  academic writing, a guide to designing and reporting simulation studies, and a
  guide to reproducible project workflows with Git and GitHub. Each document is
  written in Quarto and rendered to PDF.
type: dataset
authors:
